        "committer": {
          "name": "GitHub",
          "email": "noreply@github.com",
          "date": "2026-11-02T04:07:29Z"
        },
        "message": "fix: follow referenced arrays in the named destinations tree (#657)\n\nget_named_destinations read /Kids and /Names of each name tree node\nwith as_array(), so a node that wrote either one as an indirect\nreference to an array failed the whole walk, and get_outlines and\nget_toc returned an ObjectType error instead of the bookmarks. A /D\nwritten as a reference didn't fail, but that destination was skipped\nand the bookmark using it was left out. Now these values are\ndereferenced before they are read as arrays.",
        "tree": {
          "sha": "efb0a9358efa223531dc58f0da6bfcbc6bf62b6f",
          "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/J-F-Liu/lopdf/git/trees/efb0a9358efa223531dc58f0da6bfcbc6bf62b6f"
        },
        "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/J-F-Liu/lopdf/git/commits/8d02dcb1a4547340ed7c34ea5a43f73d3dd34952",
        "comment_count": 0,
        "verification": {
