          "payload": "tree efb0a9358efa223531dc58f0da6bfcbc6bf62b6f\nparent 0bc0f879df09390d77d7ecdc9ac9c2bf1f721c39\nauthor Luis Figueroa <62305361+LuisFigueroaG@users.noreply.github.com> 1793592449 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1793592449 +0800\n\nfix: follow referenced arrays in the named destinations tree (#657)\n\nget_named_destinations read /Kids and /Names of each name tree node\nwith as_array(), so a node that wrote either one as an indirect\nreference to an array failed the whole walk, and get_outlines and\nget_toc returned an ObjectType error instead of the bookmarks. A /D\nwritten as a reference didn't fail, but that destination was skipped\nand the bookmark using it was left out. Now these values are\ndereferenced before they are read as arrays.",
