          "payload": "tree 9a205268c2438cfa16592ac078ac3be84cfa827e\nparent be05f10eed9f33343215bd4e0c3d965b77cc1955\nauthor Luis Figueroa <62305361+LuisFigueroaG@users.noreply.github.com> 1793448941 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1793448941 +0800\n\nfix: return an inherited /Resources dictionary from get_page_resources (#654)\n\nget_page_resources only returned a /Resources dictionary written into\nthe page itself, and on the ancestors it only followed references. A\npage inheriting a /Resources dictionary written directly into a /Pages\nnode got no resources at all, so get_page_fonts was empty and\nextract_text, replace_text and replace_partial_text could not decode\nits text. Now the nearest /Resources is returned when it is a\ndictionary, whether it is on the page or on an ancestor.",
          "verified_at": "2026-10-31T12:15:41Z"
        }
