          "date": "2026-10-30T09:45:03Z"
        },
        "message": "fix: parse dates that leave out the UT offset (#652)\n\nA PDF date such as D:20240115123045 has a time of day but no UT offset.\nThe chrono, jiff and time conversions only accepted a time of day with an\noffset (or Z), so they all returned an error for it. Read such a date, with\nor without seconds, as GMT, as they already do for a date without a time\nof day.\n\nCo-authored-by: Ryan Duguid <ryanduguid@users.noreply.github.com>",
        "tree": {
          "sha": "edfa3afc98170b6a2f0edbc2967f760c9759dbbb",
          "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/J-F-Liu/lopdf/git/trees/edfa3afc98170b6a2f0edbc2967f760c9759dbbb"
        },
